<section class="about-content-section" data-component="about-content">
        <div class="about-container">
            <h2>Who We Are</h2>
            <div class="about-text">
                Leopardess Consulting brings the precision and agility of AI-powered automation to technology leaders ready to move faster. We specialize in multi-agent systems and modern web solutions that eliminate bottlenecks, accelerate deployment, and turn digital transformation from a buzzword into a competitive advantage.

Founded on the principle that technology should work for you—not the other way around—we combine deep expertise in AI orchestration, cloud architecture, and practical implementation. Our approach is straightforward: understand your challenges, design intelligent systems that address them, and deliver solutions that integrate seamlessly into your operations.

We work with CTOs, technology teams, and forward-thinking businesses who recognize that speed and adaptability aren't luxuries—they're necessities. Whether you're launching new digital products, streamlining complex workflows, or exploring how AI can genuinely improve your operations, we provide the technical depth and strategic clarity to make it happen.
            </div>

            <div class="about-highlights">

                <div class="highlight-item">
                    <h3>AI-First Methodology</h3>
                    <p>We leverage multi-agent systems and advanced LLMs to automate what traditionally requires extensive manual effort, from website deployment to complex business processes.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="highlight-item">
                    <h3>Production-Ready Focus</h3>
                    <p>Our solutions aren't prototypes or proof-of-concepts. We deliver secure, scalable systems built on enterprise-grade infrastructure like Cloudflare, ready for real-world demands.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="highlight-item">
                    <h3>Practical Transformation</h3>
                    <p>We cut through the hype to deliver actionable strategies and implementations. Our roadmaps are built for execution, not presentation decks.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="highlight-item">
                    <h3>Technical Partnership</h3>
                    <p>We work alongside your team, sharing knowledge and building capability. Your success means developing internal expertise, not creating dependency.</p>
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

<section class="team-section" data-component="leadership-team">
        <div class="team-container">
            <h2>Meet the Leadership Team</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">Leopardess Consulting is guided by experienced technology leaders who combine deep technical expertise with a passion for practical innovation. Our team brings decades of collective experience in AI systems, web architecture, and digital transformation to help businesses move forward with confidence.</p>
            <div class="team-grid">

                <div class="team-member">
                    <img src="/images/team/sarah-chen.jpg" alt="Sarah Chen" class="member-photo">
                    <h3>Sarah Chen</h3>
                    <p class="member-title">Founder & Chief Technology Officer</p>
                    <p class="member-bio">Sarah founded Leopardess Consulting after 15 years leading engineering teams at scale-ups and Fortune 500 companies. She specializes in AI-driven automation and multi-agent systems, with a track record of transforming complex technical challenges into elegant, production-ready solutions. Sarah holds a Master's in Computer Science from Stanford and is a frequent speaker on practical AI implementation.</p>
