                    <h3>Sarah Chen</h3>
                    <p class="member-title">Founder & Chief Technology Officer</p>
                    <p class="member-bio">Sarah founded Leopardess Consulting after 15 years leading engineering teams at scale-ups and Fortune 500 companies. She specializes in AI-driven automation and multi-agent systems, with a track record of transforming complex technical challenges into elegant, production-ready solutions. Sarah holds a Master's in Computer Science from Stanford and is a frequent speaker on practical AI implementation.</p>
